  "referenceNumber": "IRN0188",
  "remarks": "\nMuhammed Abd al-Razek KANAFANI is an involved person within the meaning of the Iran (Sanctions) Regulations 2023 on the basis of the following grounds: KANAFANI is or has been involved in hostile activity by the Government of Iran, namely threatening, planning or conducting attacks, including assassinations and threats to life, in countries other than Iran, including the UK. \n",
